sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor A as Analyst (browser)
    participant APP as app.py (Streamlit)
    participant ENV as .env
    participant DB as MySQL (legacy_fleet)
    APP->>ENV: Read host, port, database, default user ID
    A->>APP: User ID + password (typed)
    APP->>DB: connect() + SELECT 1 as bi_analyst
    alt password accepted
        DB-->>APP: OK
        APP-->>A: Sidebar + Fleet Overview
        A->>APP: Choose a report and filters
        APP->>DB: run_query(): SELECT with named parameters
        DB-->>APP: Rows with cryptic column names
        APP-->>A: Labels, KPIs, charts, map, table
        APP-->>A: Back-end panel: SQL, rows, ms
    else wrong password or server down
        DB-->>APP: ERROR 1045 / 2003
        APP-->>A: Login failed + hint
    end
